recorded in the git history of this branch.

It does not cover:

- the upstream files of this repository, including the core (Katsumi Degawa, freeware
  for non-commercial use), T80, T48 and the MiST scandoubler
- content of the Basys 3 wrapper taken from the upstream board top
- third-party code added for the port: Xilinx Clocking Wizard, make_vhdl_prom.c

These keep the terms stated in their files.

